{
  "info": {
    "name": "EgyptOnline Contract System - Full API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for EgyptOnline contract system. Covers the full 2-party contract lifecycle, dual-scenario daily payout, admin dispute resolution, wallet management, and complaints."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Admin JWT token — obtain from POST /Auth/login"
    },
    {
      "key": "clientToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Client JWT token — obtain from POST /Auth/login"
    },
    {
      "key": "providerToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Provider (worker) JWT token — obtain from POST /Auth/login"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📋 Contract Lifecycle",
      "description": "Full 2-party contract flow: create → accept/reject → arrive → confirm/report → auto-payout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Contract",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"serviceProviderPhoneNumber\": \"01000000000\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-07-10\",\n  \"shiftStartTime\": \"08:00:00\",\n  \"shiftEndTime\": \"17:00:00\",\n  \"totalDays\": 5,\n  \"dailySalary\": 200,\n  \"penaltyAmount\": 300,\n  \"governorate\": \"القاهرة\",\n  \"city\": \"مدينة نصر\",\n  \"district\": \"الحي العاشر\",\n  \"detailedAddress\": \"شارع 123، مبنى 45\",\n  \"notes\": \"ملاحظات اختيارية\",\n  \"restrictedTerms\": \"شروط خاصة اختيارية\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts"]
            },
            "description": "Client creates a contract.\n\n💰 MONEY FLOW:\n- `dailySalary × totalDays` = TotalAmount auto-calculated\n- Freezes `TotalAmount + penaltyAmount` from client FreeBalance → FrozenBalance immediately.\n\n⚠️ If contract is not accepted before startDate, funds are auto-unfrozen by the background service."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Provider Accept Contract",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{providerToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/:id/accept",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", ":id", "accept"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Provider accepts the contract.\n\n💰 MONEY FLOW:\n- Checks provider has ≥ penaltyAmount in FreeBalance\n- Freezes penaltyAmount from provider FreeBalance → FrozenBalance\n- Contract status → active"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Provider Reject Contract",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{providerToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/:id/reject",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", ":id", "reject"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Provider rejects the contract.\n\n💰 MONEY FLOW:\n- Returns TotalAmount + penaltyAmount from client FrozenBalance → client FreeBalance immediately.\n- Contract status → cancelled"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Arrival (Worker)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{providerToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contractId\": 1,\n  \"dayNumber\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/arrival",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", "arrival"]
            },
            "description": "Worker presses Arrive for the day.\n\nAfter this, the client can either:\n  ✅ Confirm attendance → wages released at shiftEnd\n  🚫 Report absence → contract suspended, complaint filed\n  ⏳ Do nothing → wages auto-released 3 hours after shiftEnd"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm Attendance (Client) ⭐",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contractId\": 1,\n  \"dayNumber\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/confirm-attendance",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", "confirm-attendance"]
            },
            "description": "Client confirms the worker arrived and is present.\n\n💰 PAYOUT SCENARIO 1 (Direct Confirmation):\n- Sets clientConfirmed = true\n- Background service will release dailySalary exactly at shiftEndTime (no 3-hour wait)\n\nRequirements:\n- Worker must have already pressed Arrive\n- Cannot confirm if day is under dispute"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Report Dispute / Absence (Client) 🚨",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contractId\": 1,\n  \"dayNumber\": 1,\n  \"reason\": \"العامل لم يحضر لموقع العمل\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/dispute",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", "dispute"]
            },
            "description": "Client reports that the worker was absent or there is an issue.\n\n⚡ EFFECTS:\n- Contract status → suspended (freezes all daily movements)\n- Contract day status → AbsentDisputed\n- Auto-creates a Complaint (reportType: daily_absence)\n- Admin must resolve before the contract can continue"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Terminate Contract (Client or Worker)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"سبب إنهاء العقد\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/:id/terminate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", ":id", "terminate"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Single endpoint for either party to terminate the contract.\n\n⚡ EFFECTS:\n- Detects if caller is client or provider automatically\n- Funds remain frozen for admin manual resolution\n- Auto-creates a Complaint (reportType: unilateral_termination_request)\n- Admin must use one of the resolve endpoints to distribute funds"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Contracts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/my?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", "my"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns all contracts for the logged-in user (as client or as provider)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Contract by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/contracts/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["contracts", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Get full contract details. Only accessible by the client or provider parties."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔧 Admin — Dispute Resolution",
      "description": "Admin endpoints for resolving suspended/terminated contracts and distributing frozen funds.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Terminated Contracts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/contracts/terminated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "contracts", "terminated"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lists all terminated/suspended contracts awaiting admin resolution."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Contract Details (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/contracts/:id/details",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "contracts", ":id", "details"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Full details including both parties' wallet balances (free and frozen), contract days status, and termination info."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resolve — Adjust & Resume ▶️",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"daysWorked\": 2,\n  \"direction\": \"client_to_worker\",\n  \"comment\": \"تعويض العامل عن يومين عمل واستئناف العقد\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/contracts/:id/resolve/adjust-resume",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "contracts", ":id", "resolve", "adjust-resume"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Contract ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Admin makes a partial balance adjustment based on days worked then resumes the contract.\n\nFields:\n- daysWorked: number of days worked (int ≥ 0)\n- direction:\n    'client_to_free' → returns (daysWorked × dailySalary) from client frozen → client free\n    'client_to_worker' → pays (daysWorked × dailySalary) from client frozen → worker free\n\n⚡ Contract status → active. All open complaints resolved."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Override User Balance",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"balanceType\": \"free\",\n  \"amount\": 500,\n  \"operation\": \"add\",\n  \"reason\": \"Dispute resolution - Contract #123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/users/:userId/balance/override",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "users", ":userId", "balance", "override"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "userId", "value": "", "description": "User ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Direct wallet override for edge cases.\n- balanceType: 'free' or 'frozen'\n- operation: 'add' or 'deduct'"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔧 Admin — Complaints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Complaints",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/complaints?status=open&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "complaints"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "open", "description": "open | under_review | resolved | rejected" },
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filter by status. ReportType field now available: dispute | daily_absence | mutual_termination_request | unilateral_termination_request"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review Complaint",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"under_review\",\n  \"adminNote\": \"Reviewing the case\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/complaints/:id/review",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "complaints", ":id", "review"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1", "description": "Complaint ID" }]
            },
            "description": "Update complaint status. Values: under_review | resolved | rejected"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔧 Admin — Deposits & Withdrawals",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Pending Deposits",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/deposits/pending?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "deposits", "pending"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review Deposit",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\",\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/deposits/:id/review",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "deposits", ":id", "review"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Approve or reject a user deposit. status: approved | rejected"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Pending Withdrawals",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/withdrawals/pending?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "withdrawals", "pending"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review Withdrawal",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\",\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Admin/withdrawals/:id/review",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Admin", "withdrawals", ":id", "review"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Approve or reject a user withdrawal. status: approved | rejected"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💰 Wallet",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Balance",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Wallet/balance",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Wallet", "balance"]
            },
            "description": "Returns freeBalance, frozenBalance, and totalBalance.\n\nWorkers will see their committed (frozen) wages here — e.g. frozenBalance: 2000 EGP means 2000 is secured and waiting for them."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Deposit Request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "amount", "value": "500", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "sourceWalletNumber", "value": "01000000000", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "walletOwnerName", "value": "Ahmed Mohamed", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "recipientWalletNumber", "value": "01111111111", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "receiptImage", "src": "", "type": "file", "description": "Image of the payment receipt" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Wallet/deposit",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Wallet", "deposit"]
            },
            "description": "Submit a manual deposit request with receipt image (multipart/form-data). Admin must approve before balance is credited."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Withdrawal Request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 300,\n  \"walletNumber\": \"01000000000\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Wallet/withdraw",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Wallet", "withdraw"]
            },
            "description": "Request a withdrawal from free balance. Admin must approve."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Transactions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Wallet/transactions?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Wallet", "transactions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageNumber", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
